  m_text: "<b>3 \xB7 FORCE AREA</b>\nA trigger box that pushes every Rigidbody inside it.\nA: the ball rolls off the deck through a sideways force. Strength 4 misses:\n    tune the Strength until it lands in the basket.\nB: the force points straight up: what does the ball do?"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
